# =============================================================================
# MediCitas · Colección de peticiones HTTP versionada (§5 del enunciado)
#
# Compatible con la extensión REST Client de VS Code y con el cliente HTTP de
# JetBrains. Ejecutar primero el bloque 1 para cargar los tokens en variables.
# =============================================================================

@apiUrl = http://localhost:3000
@keycloakUrl = http://localhost:8080
@realm = medicitas
@clientId = medicitas-api

# =============================================================================
# 1. OBTENCIÓN DE TOKENS EN KEYCLOAK (RF17)
# Todos los usuarios de demostración usan la contraseña: medicitas
# =============================================================================

### 1.1 Token de recepción (Clínica San José)
# @name loginRecepcion
POST {{keycloakUrl}}/realms/{{realm}}/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id={{clientId}}&username=recepcion.sanjose&password=medicitas

###
@receptionToken = {{loginRecepcion.response.body.access_token}}

### 1.2 Token de administrador de clínica (Clínica San José)
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{keycloakUrl}}/realms/{{realm}}/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id={{clientId}}&username=admin.sanjose&password=medicitas

###
@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.access_token}}

### 1.3 Token de profesional (Dra. Laura Mora, Clínica San José)
# @name loginProfesional
POST {{keycloakUrl}}/realms/{{realm}}/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id={{clientId}}&username=laura.mora&password=medicitas

###
@professionalToken = {{loginProfesional.response.body.access_token}}

### 1.4 Token de administrador de plataforma
# @name loginPlataforma
POST {{keycloakUrl}}/realms/{{realm}}/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id={{clientId}}&username=plataforma&password=medicitas

###
@platformToken = {{loginPlataforma.response.body.access_token}}

### 1.5 Token de otra clínica (Recepción Cartago, para pruebas de aislamiento I5)
# @name loginCartago
POST {{keycloakUrl}}/realms/{{realm}}/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id={{clientId}}&username=recepcion.cartago&password=medicitas

###
@cartagoToken = {{loginCartago.response.body.access_token}}


# =============================================================================
# 2. SALUD E IDENTIDAD RESUELTA (/health y /me)
# =============================================================================

### 2.1 Estado de salud de la pila (200 OK, sin token)
GET {{apiUrl}}/health

### 2.2 Identidad resuelta del token en la clínica (200 OK)
GET {{apiUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{receptionToken}}


# =============================================================================
# 3. CICLO COMPLETO DE UNA CITA (RF7, RF8, RF9, RF10, RF11, RF12, RF13, I7, I8)
# =============================================================================

### 3.1 Consultar disponibilidad de un profesional en una fecha (RF7 — 1ª vez: X-MediCitas-Cache: miss)
GET {{apiUrl}}/availability/professionals/6?serviceId=1&date=2026-11-16
Authorization: Bearer {{receptionToken}}

### 3.2 Repetir la consulta de disponibilidad (RF7, I8 — 2ª vez: X-MediCitas-Cache: hit desde Redis)
GET {{apiUrl}}/availability/professionals/6?serviceId=1&date=2026-11-16
Authorization: Bearer {{receptionToken}}

### 3.3 Consultar disponibilidad por servicio en un rango de fechas (RF8)
GET {{apiUrl}}/availability/services/1?from=2026-11-16&to=2026-11-20
Authorization: Bearer {{receptionToken}}

### 3.4 Reservar una cita en un espacio disponible (RF9, I4 — 201 Created; invalida la caché de ese día)
# @name crearCita
POST {{apiUrl}}/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{receptionToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": 1,
  "professionalId": 6,
  "serviceId": 1,
  "start": "2026-11-16T08:00:00-06:00",
  "description": "Control general de demostración"
}

###
@citaId = {{crearCita.response.body.appointmentId}}

### 3.5 Reprogramar la cita a un nuevo horario en una sola transacción (RF10, I7 — 201 Created)
# @name reprogramarCita
POST {{apiUrl}}/appointments/{{citaId}}/reschedule
Authorization: Bearer {{receptionToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "start": "2026-11-16T08:30:00-06:00"
}

###
@citaReprogramadaId = {{reprogramarCita.response.body.appointmentId}}

### 3.6 Cancelar la cita reprogramada con motivo (RF11, I7 — 200 OK; libera el espacio de inmediato)
POST {{apiUrl}}/appointments/{{citaReprogramadaId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{receptionToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "El paciente solicitó cancelar por viaje imprevisto"
}

### 3.7 Registrar el desenlace de una cita cuya hora de inicio ya pasó (RF12 — 200 OK)
POST {{apiUrl}}/appointments/1/outcome
Authorization: Bearer {{professionalToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "outcome": "atendida"
}


# =============================================================================
# 4. ADMINISTRACIÓN DE CLÍNICAS Y USUARIOS (RF1, RF2)
# =============================================================================

### 4.1 Listar usuarios de la clínica del token (RF2, I5 — 200 OK)
GET {{apiUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 4.2 Dar de alta una clínica nueva y su administrador inicial (RF1 — 201 Created)
POST {{apiUrl}}/clinics
Authorization: Bearer {{platformToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clinicCode": "CR-HER",
  "clinicName": "MediCitas Heredia",
  "timeZone": "America/Costa_Rica",
  "admin": {
    "username": "admin.heredia",
    "email": "admin.heredia@medicitas.example",
    "name": " Valeria",
    "lastName": "Solís Mora",
    "password": "medicitas",
    "temporaryPassword": false
  }
}


# =============================================================================
# 5. CASOS DE RECHAZO: 400, 401, 403, 404 (I5) Y 409 (I1, I2, RF12, RF13)
# =============================================================================

### 5.1 [401 Unauthorized] Petición sin encabezado Authorization
GET {{apiUrl}}/users

### 5.2 [401 Unauthorized] Token con firma adulterada
GET {{apiUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIxMjMifQ.firma_invalida

### 5.3 [403 Forbidden] Recepción intenta administrar usuarios (carece del permiso users.manage)
GET {{apiUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{receptionToken}}

### 5.4 [403 Forbidden] Un profesional intenta cancelar una cita (carece de appointments.manage)
POST {{apiUrl}}/appointments/1/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{professionalToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Intento de cancelación por profesional"
}

### 5.5 [403 Forbidden] Administrador de plataforma intenta usar el servicio agenda
GET {{apiUrl}}/availability/professionals/6?serviceId=1&date=2026-11-16
Authorization: Bearer {{platformToken}}

### 5.6 [400 Bad Request] Intento de enviar el fin de la cita (I4) o inyectar clinicId en el body (I5)
POST {{apiUrl}}/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{receptionToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clinicId": 2,
  "patientId": 1,
  "professionalId": 6,
  "serviceId": 1,
  "start": "2026-11-16T09:00:00-06:00",
  "end": "2026-11-16T09:30:00-06:00"
}

### 5.7 [400 Bad Request] Cita fuera del horario de atención del profesional (I3, código SQLSTATE MC001)
POST {{apiUrl}}/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{receptionToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": 1,
  "professionalId": 6,
  "serviceId": 1,
  "start": "2026-11-16T03:00:00-06:00"
}

### 5.8 [404 Not Found] Aislamiento multi-tenant (I5): recepción de Cartago intenta leer o cancelar recursos de San José
POST {{apiUrl}}/appointments/{{citaId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{cartagoToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Intento de tocar una cita de otra clínica"
}

### 5.9 [409 Conflict] Doble reserva del mismo espacio con el mismo profesional (I1, ex_appointments_professional)
POST {{apiUrl}}/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{receptionToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": 2,
  "professionalId": 6,
  "serviceId": 1,
  "start": "2026-11-16T09:30:00-06:00"
}

### 5.10 [409 Conflict] Segunda reserva sobre el mismo espacio 09:30 (I1 — rechazada con 409)
POST {{apiUrl}}/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{receptionToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": 3,
  "professionalId": 6,
  "serviceId": 1,
  "start": "2026-11-16T09:30:00-06:00"
}

### 5.11 [409 Conflict] Intentar modificar o volver a cancelar una cita que ya está en estado final (RF13, MC002)
POST {{apiUrl}}/appointments/{{citaReprogramadaId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{receptionToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Segundo intento de cancelación sobre una cita ya cancelada"
}

### 5.12 [409 Conflict] Intentar registrar desenlace de una cita futura antes de su hora de inicio (RF12, MC003)
POST {{apiUrl}}/appointments/{{citaId}}/outcome
Authorization: Bearer {{receptionToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "outcome": "atendida"
}
